tion or control system d.3 Reiteration: Physical Phenomenon repetition in the affected installation: This installation has not been affected by the same physical phenomenon, during the last 24 mobile months. Reiteration Physical Phenomenon in facilities of the same owner: Failures have occurred in facilities of the same owner with the same physical phenomenon, during the last 24 mobile months: FALLA NAME_FALLA DATE_FALLA ACTIONS_CORRECTIVAS Failure in S/","es":"Estudio para an\u00e1lisis de falla EAF 161/2025\n\u201cFalla en el cierre del interruptor 52C12 de S/E Palafitos\u201d\nFecha de Emisi\u00f3n: 28-04-2025\n1. Descripci\u00f3n pormenorizada de la perturbaci\u00f3n\na. Fecha y Hora de la falla\nFecha 06/04/2025\nHora 07:50\nConsumos desconectados (MW) 0.95\nDemanda previa del sistema (MW) 8089.23\nPorcentaje de desconexi\u00f3n 0.012 %\nCalificaci\u00f3n Apag\u00f3n No aplica (porcentaje de desconexi\u00f3n < 10%)\nb. Identificaci\u00f3n instalaci\u00f3n afectada\nNombre de la instalaci\u00f3n S/E Palafitos / SE283T0058\nTipo de instalaci\u00f3n Subestaci\u00f3n\nTensi\u00f3n nominal 110 y 13.8 kV\nSegmento Transmisi\u00f3n Zonal\nPropietario instalaci\u00f3n afectada CGE Transmisi\u00f3n S.A.\nRUT 77.465.741-K\nRepresentante Legal Iv\u00e1n Quezada Escobar\nDirecci\u00f3n Av. Presidente Riesco N\u00b05561 piso 14, Las Condes, Regi\u00f3n Metropolitana de\nSantiago\nc. Identificaci\u00f3n del elemento fallado\nNombre del elemento afectado Sistema de control del interruptor 52C12 de S/E Palafitos /\nSP0200T0058SE283T0058 (*)\nPropietario elemento fallado CGE Transmisi\u00f3n S.A.\nRUT 77.465.741-K\nRepresentante Legal Iv\u00e1n Quezada Escobar\nDirecci\u00f3n Av. Presidente Riesco N\u00b05561 piso 14, Las Condes, Regi\u00f3n Metropolitana de\nSantiago\n- (*) El nemot\u00e9cnico corresponde al pa\u00f1o asociado al sistema de protecci\u00f3n del interruptor 52C12 de S/E Palafitos.\nd.1 Origen y causa de la falla\nCon ocasi\u00f3n de maniobras de normalizaci\u00f3n del interruptor 52C12 de S/E Palafitos, asociado al\nalimentador Diego Portales, se produjo una falla en el cierre remoto del equipo. El interruptor 52C12\nde S/E Palafitos se encontraba previamente en estado abierto debido a falla en redes de media tensi\u00f3n.\nd.2 Fen\u00f3meno F\u00edsico:\nOPE26: Falla en sistema de protecci\u00f3n o control\nd.3 Reiteraci\u00f3n:\nReiteraci\u00f3n Fen\u00f3meno F\u00edsico en la instalaci\u00f3n afectada: Esta instalaci\u00f3n no ha sido afectada por el\nmismo fen\u00f3meno f\u00edsico","shown_language":"en","word_scores":[{"w":"study","s":0.13},{"w":"fault","s":0.09},{"w":"analysis","s":-0.02},{"w":"eaf","s":0.02},{"w":"2025","s":-0.12},{"w":"fault","s":0.09},{"w":"switch","s":0.6},{"w":"date","s":0.01},{"w":"date","s":0.01},{"w":"time","s":0.11},{"w":"failure","s":0.1},{"w":"date","s":0.01},{"w":"06","s":0.1},{"w":"04","s":-0.3},{"w":"2025","s":-0.12},{"w":"time","s":0.11},{"w":"07","s":-0.21},{"w":"mw","s":0.06},{"w":"prior","s":0.07},{"w":"mw","s":0.06},{"w":"23","s":-0.56},{"w":"percentage","s":0.06},{"w":"disconnection","s":-0.14}]},"predictions":{"conflux":{"pred":"breaker_fault","display_pred":"BREAKER FAULT","probs":{"line_fault":0.0099,"breaker_fault":0.5842,"transformer_fault":0.1636,"busbar_fault":0.2424},"confidence":0.5842,"correct":true},"quorum":{"pred":"breaker_fault","display_pred":"BREAKER FAULT","probs":{"line_fault":0.3411,"breaker_fault":0.3421,"transformer_fault":0.1296,"busbar_fault":0.1872},"confidence":0.3421,"correct":true},"nexus":{"pred":"breaker_fault","display_pred":"BREAKER FAULT","probs":{"line_fault":0.1343,"breaker_fault":0.5151,"transformer_fault":0.2148,"busbar_fault":0.1357},"confidence":0.5151,"correct":true}},"explanations":{"conflux":{"method":"Exact Shapley (Modality) + Gradient Attribution (Within-Modality)","contrib":{"D":{"share":0.0622,"signed":-0.05},"T":{"share":0.2302,"signed":-0.1852},"R":{"share":0.7076,"signed":0.5694}},"dominant":"R","telemetry_importance":[0.3181,0.4507